\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293830/extras/f7c5121572ce64e09c855ad22f4fea34.poster.avif?t=1734336342\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293830/extras/f7c5121572ce64e09c855ad22f4fea34.webm?t=1734336342\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\"][/imgvid]\r\n[b]收集超过 450 辆车辆[/b]\r\n尽情享受包含超过 100 个授权车厂的最庞大和最多元化地平线车辆名单。[h2][/h2]\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293830/extras/71c4de2cd2f84fb912ebdfc5c73cfeb1.poster.avif?t=1734336342\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293830/extras/71c4de2cd2f84fb912ebdfc5c73cfeb1.webm?t=1734336342\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\"][/imgvid]\r\n[b]尽情竞速、表演特技、创造和探索。[/b]\r\n在全新开放式剧情中，您做的任何事情都能推进您的游戏进度。[h2][/h2]\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293830/extras/a66b131a159930da723764394f4fbd5d.poster.avif?t=1734336342\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293830/extras/a66b131a159930da723764394f4fbd5d.webm?t=1734336342\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\"][/imgvid]\r\n[b]探索开放世界[/b]\r\n现实玩家将遍布在您的世界中。所有游戏玩家都能在同一时间体验时间、天气和四季的变化。\r\n[h2][/h2]\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293830/extras/4ab994c8c03f6c0ea519a3904d0b192c.poster.avif?t=1734336342\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293830/extras/4ab994c8c03f6c0ea519a3904d0b192c.webm?t=1734336342\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\"][/imgvid]\r\n[b]探索美丽而富有历史气息的英国[/b]\r\n体验您从未见过的英国。在壮丽的原生 4K 和 HDR 中探索湖泊、山谷、城堡和美不胜收的风景。","strSnippet":"在世界上最盛大的汽车嘉年华上，不断变化的赛季改变着一切。单枪匹马或者与其他人组队，在一个共享开放世界中探索美丽而富有历史气息的英国。收集、改装和驾驶超过 450 辆车辆。尽情竞速、表演特技、创造和探索：选择您专属的方式来成为地平线中的超级巨星。"}}]]